  "content": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Dirigentes sociales y vecinos participaron en la conformación del Comité de Salud Urbano de Maullín, instancia realizada en la sala multiuso del hospital.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Este espacio busca fortalecer el trabajo conjunto entre la comunidad, los equipos de salud y autoridades locales, promoviendo acciones colaborativas para el bienestar de la salud pública en la comuna.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"📢\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t39/1/16/1f4e2.png\"/> El comité está abierto a la comunidad. Próximamente se informarán las fechas de las próximas reuniones.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">fuente munimaullin.cl</p>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-10 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11015\" data-id=\"11015\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/5q7540vijc4jvyg/comite_03_1024x683_0ewvavvo77.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11011\" data-id=\"11011\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/cmjdpkv581bmbkh/comite_04_1024x683_1ctukduwwc.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11013\" data-id=\"11013\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/pty0yrmp9xt8baw/comite_05_1024x683_tob8p83yyn.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11010\" data-id=\"11010\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/w8j369gzcyhrgld/comite_06_1024x683_n4g3hyu0yj.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11012\" data-id=\"11012\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/qollcr6y5kvkeqq/comite_07_1024x683_mzmfvvv9pp.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n</figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11014\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/3y40vin18mlh83g/comite_02_1024x683_wo7f6uyzue.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>"
